The energy-loss, fluctuation and material code re-implements published Geant4 11.3.2 models (G4MuBetheBlochModel,
G4UniversalFluctuation, G4UrbanFluctuation, G4EmSaturation, G4IonisParamMat, G4DensityEffectData) in Python; Geant4
is distributed under the Geant4 Software License. Code first written in mu2e-crv-fastsim (commit f451d7b).

Mu2e-internal inputs (conditions, calibration and lookup tables, detector data) and physics results are not part of
this repository and must not be added to it.

The optional cry_tables/cry_device modules re-implement the published CRY 1.7 model (LLNL UCRL-CODE-227323).
The retained CRY redistribution and additional DOE notices are in docs/third-party/cry.txt. CRY is not Apache-2.0;
the distribution tables are external hash-verified runtime inputs, not repository contents.
